<title>UK: ICI shares gain on acquistion report.</title>
<headline>ICI shares gain on acquistion report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperical Chemical Industries Plc shares rose on Friday after a report in the Daily Mail said the company was planning a major European acquisition to achieve its target of becoming a world leader in industrial coatings.</p>
<p>The stock was up 4-1/2p at 764-1/2 in thin volume of 34,319 shares.  </p>
<p>Citing unnamed sources, the Daily Mail report said ICI had been ready to press ahead with its plans in early December but pulled back when markets nosedived -- making a planned 1 billion stg rights issue to finance the bid more difficult to launch.  </p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
